; The drums are channel 10, as eight tracks, drum1–drum8, so hits sound
; together. The kit's roles are built in, each at its GM key: kick, snare,
; hat, hat-open, crash, ride, the toms …
; Try: add the hats on a track of their own, (drum2 hat :len 8 c c c c c c c c).
(def-score :target midi)
(drum1 :len 4 kick c snare c kick c snare c)
